53
00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:52.540
This is fascinating.

54
00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.490
Students are learning how to be happy.

55
00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:56.900
Yeah, the Wall Street Journal reports

56
00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.980
the hottest class at Harvard Business School,

57
00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.370
heard of Harvard?

58
00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:02.520
Is called Leadership and Happiness

59
00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:03.920 line:15%
and it's taught by Arthur Brooks

60
00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.410 line:15%
and he uses science, academic studies,

61
00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:08.890 line:15%
Buddhist teachings and Bible verses,

62
00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:12.680 line:15%
to help students learn how to cultivate their own happiness.

63
00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.320 line:15%
And he says, "happiness comes from

64
00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:16.200 line:15%
four key areas in your life."

65
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.033 line:15%
Listen up.

66
00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:19.220 line:15%
He says "friends, family,

67
00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:22.770 line:15%
