121
00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:34.960
and you cultivate it and you harness it,

122
00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:38.540
I think happy is very hard to achieve.

123
00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.770
Absolutely, but it is worth it, if you can find it.

124
00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.243
It is!
(audience applauds)

125
00:04:42.243 --> 00:04:47.060
And we have to figure out ways in which to do that.

126
00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:50.010
And it's different for everyone,

127
00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.570
and it's a multi-layered thing,

128
00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:56.340
and I'm glad to see that our wellness

129
00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:59.960
