130
00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:03.110
can be fostered in a college community.

131
00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.860
I think this is so good.

132
00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.749
Yeah.
Life matters.

133
00:05:06.749 --> 00:05:08.036
(audience applauds)
Absolutely.

134
00:05:08.036 --> 00:05:10.364 line:15%
I wish I could take that course, maybe we can?

135
